# iPhone chart fix — v5.1

The previous mobile build used Streamlit's Plotly frontend. On some iPhone Safari/PWA sessions it can show:

`TypeError: Importing a module script failed.`

Version 5.1 replaces all Plotly panels used by the mobile app with server-generated inline SVG. The chart therefore does not depend on a JavaScript module and works in Safari and Home Screen web-app mode.

## Update your GitHub repository

Upload and replace these two files:

1. `mobile_app.py`
2. `gold_web_terminal/mobile_svg.py`

Then Streamlit Community Cloud will redeploy automatically. If it does not, open the app menu and choose **Reboot app**.

No change is required in Streamlit Secrets.
